Validate the following scenarios based on these rules:

Rule 1:
Gap < 3 Hours
    -> Same Shift

Gap >= 3 Hours
    -> New Shift

Rule 2:
Night Shift Carry Forward is applied only on the FIRST activity of a NEW shift.

Rule 3:
If first activity of a new shift occurs between 12:00 AM and 05:30 AM

    Previous Day Summary Exists
        -> Current Day

    Previous Day Summary Does Not Exist
        -> Previous Day

Rule 4:
Once a shift receives a LogDate, every activity belonging to that shift inherits the same LogDate.

